Name: zx
Short Name: zx
URL: https://github.com/google/zx
License: Apache-2.0
License File: LICENSE
Version: HEAD
Revision: HEAD
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes
Forks:
  - https://github.com/aphrody-labs/zx
  - https://github.com/yolo-rs/zx

Description:
A tool for writing better scripts, originally developed by Google. Provides a concise syntax
for executing child processes and managing pipelines.

Local Modifications:
- Forked to aphrody-labs/zx and yolo-rs/zx.
- Native re-architecture for Upstream Bun (v1.4.4+) via packages/zx-bun:
  - Powered by Bun.$ with zero-overhead native streams and pipe redirection.
  - Zero Node.js or child_process dependencies.
  - Native Bun.Glob, Bun.file, chalk/ansis styling, and Google Shell Design System tokens.
